    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>SpecFit enables customers to virtually try eyeglasses, sunglasses, and optical frames directly from WooCommerce product pages using mobile cameras or desktop webcams.</p>\n<p>The virtual try-on technology, AI processing, product rendering, and 3D pipeline are powered by TrynShop.</p>\n<h3>Demo</h3>\n<p>TrynShop demo store:<br />\nhttps://trynshop.com/shop/dugudlabs</p>\n<h3>Shortcode Fallbacks</h3>\n<p>If your theme does not render the default WooCommerce hooks correctly, you can place these shortcodes manually:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Category page try-on widget:<br />\n  [specfit_tryon_widget]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Product page try-on button:<br />\n  [specfit_product_tryon_button]</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Install and activate the plugin.</li>\n<li>You will be redirected to the SpecFit setup page.</li>\n<li>Enter your email address and verify the OTP.</li>\n<li>Select the Free plan.</li>\n<li>Enter your shop information and link your shop.</li>\n<li>The embedded TrynShop product manager will list your WooCommerce products.</li>\n<li>For each product, select the front and side images, then request 3D try-on.</li>\n<li>The try-on model is usually ready in 1-2 hours. Once ready, virtual try-on is enabled for that product.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20require%20woocommerce%3F\">\nDoes this require WooCommerce?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. WooCommerce must be installed and activated.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20support%203d%20virtual%20try-on%3F\">\nDoes this support 3D virtual try-on?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. 3D-enabled products are processed through TrynShop Studio.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>10.0.43</h4>\n<p>Improved WordPress update metadata and automatic Try On status synchronization.</p>\n<h4>10.0.33</h4>\n<p>Major update with TrynShop integration, AI-powered virtual try-on improvements, automatic product processing, and cloud-powered synchronization support.</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "AI virtual try-on for WooCommerce eyewear stores, powered by TrynShop.",
    "description": "<p>SpecFit enables customers to virtually try eyeglasses, sunglasses, and optical frames directly from WooCommerce product pages using mobile cameras or desktop webcams.</p>\n<p>The virtual try-on technology, AI processing, product rendering, and 3D pipeline are powered by TrynShop.</p>\n<h3>Demo</h3>\n<p>TrynShop demo store:<br />\nhttps://trynshop.com/shop/dugudlabs</p>\n<h3>Shortcode Fallbacks</h3>\n<p>If your theme does not render the default WooCommerce hooks correctly, you can place these shortcodes manually:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Category page try-on widget:<br />\n  [specfit_tryon_widget]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Product page try-on button:<br />\n  [specfit_product_tryon_button]</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
